      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Starlink is much bigger than faster internet\n\nIt gives a country an entirely new layer of infrastructure that reaches people traditional networks still cannot\n\nMore connectivity means more education, more businesses, more productivity and more people connected to the global economy\n\nCountries that move fast will benefit from it\n\nCountries that keep delaying are choosing to leave that growth on the table",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {},
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2107998540073181440",
