      "text": "Starlink beams are turned off over India, so the claim that they were used by anyone for any reason is absolutely false",
      "quote": {
        "author": "cb_doge",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1498070100393754625/C2V-fbll_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 04:22:42",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-07T20:22:42.000Z",
        "id": "2107929632611893361",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUDcgwlbQAA6Fre.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1254,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUDcgwlbQAA6Fre.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1254
          }
        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "The claim that militants used Starlink in India makes no sense.\n\nStarlink satellite beams are turned off over India. With the beams off, no Starlink device can connect in India.\n\nEven Elon Musk himself has confirmed this.\n\nStop spreading misinformation.",
        "url": "https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2107929632611893361",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
