      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "🚨 STARLINK IS READY TO SERVE INDIA\n\nSpaceX’s Starlink Vice President Lauren Dreyer said the company is prepared to bring internet to India right now.\n\nThey have already built 20 gateway sites with hundreds of antennas, plus strong security controls and all user data stored inside the country.\n\nStarlink could connect 100% of India and get people online in just minutes.\n\nShe added: “We stand ready to serve India, as soon as India is ready!” https://x.com/ANI/status/2107734328780501192/video/1",
      "quote": null,
