          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUC4wcPaEAAT-O0.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 900,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUC4wcPaEAAT-O0.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1600
          }
        ],
        "name": "eric zakariasson",
        "text": "grok @bot 0.68.1 is out!\n\n- Bots can build slide decks with you and deliver them as PowerPoint or Google Slides\n- send formatted emails straight from a draft card\n- your messages in a 1:1 chat take that Bot's color\n- faster computer use, now on a 1920x1200 screen\n\nhttps://x.ai/changelog/bot",
        "url": "https://x.com/ericzakariasson/status/2107887770937283028",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
